      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日积月累的努力必会成为\r\n朝目标迈进的能量。\r\n今天也要努力进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e24c3e720a93ef226ec73ba5c4c69c89518a943267a66c5a64064212f3dfa1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
