    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5abcd0e918d631a32fcf12c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "糟糕……感觉身体很沉重。\r\n但我不想浪费任何一天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02dc93ee185d35f5581643df2dd3ad7bccf18b94a1d837d0c0892f85dfe28eb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ede1c5377e3ffe2b1d3270d2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没办法发挥平时的水平……\r\n虽然我知道不该是这样的表现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d318e2f97503e3d6ac99dfcfcb36ccd18adc6b7b0384f89885d7809087241a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36c780581be8e6648bc0edc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近一直连续在比赛……\r\n没事，我会尽我所能的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d68417be66d17e531f01d3cc884484609a65a546a36a0d155deffee03edce56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73961e138dc75573d5044b0e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会拼命去做……\r\n但这样的努力不一定能达到\r\n预期的成果，希望你能有所觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0244bd509396a961aa0162ddb9e8bf2caca4bd283d2427a62bfaee18551e348b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62bcd8d913bccf07701e825",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉有股力量从体内涌出。\r\n我会威风凛凛地跑赢这场比赛的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4932e236bfe42a11ee9f5dabb6767d0f536631bab264aa340d8fc8c4e2d6f050",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b4ccffb4f95fc8f2b04adb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说比赛是没有「绝对」的，\r\n但现在的我应该能让你看见……\r\n「绝对」的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550b65f3808918ee6288012a25d9edc7c213dc0b07a937e56775736999121675",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fa871a2818660c671a0b4c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，很庆幸能在如此\r\n情绪高昂的状态下参赛。\r\n现在就已经等不及要开跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7e996cc54fe7c9e19c61cd08302487eeb620b3645465ff0b9b44b94acbdb88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d18594f3e50a4f2c209457",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在能像这样以理想的状态参赛，\r\n都归功于训练员的手腕。\r\n我会用结果来回报你的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "364c0e81f9c6e6d3ac2730c7c47be052a8854100eaf949b08bc7603adc874a40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc84eeabce21d43f4f0ae7c2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不用担心，\r\n今天是超越平时的绝佳状态。\r\n感觉能跑出好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9657544296c2081992340a4755e63b36cbc8269125640fa903f45ba397e9d4de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd3d3b32f45a69e63d0f2357",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，心里充满了期待。\r\n看来是能带好消息回来给你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb36d7114161dbb17c9abd09a93b840b217298d2c74e2fd221050b0861878414",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb3b2edc6c40a3718bc078e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使被誉为「皇帝」也不能骄傲，\r\n必须专心迎战眼前的比赛……\r\n我会用尽全力去跑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89bf40b1169282ce69b28739efc378c42b17998a8b6f1c98d221cca49acfe302",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1017/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:738db21ffc0b74aed132940e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心情十分平静，\r\n剩下的就只是上场用尽全力奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83149f255a54735ec54c5dd47e7850e18e64a15a178db0eb2056bbcd7e6fd8fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
